messages.text:
I bet athletes are not satisfied
with their games.{be01}
That's how I feel
when I watch them.{be01}
The reason? If you win against me,
I will tell you why!{be01}

No matter how great their play is,
there is always a greater play.{be01}
I am never satisfied with my bread,
even though I bake it very well.{be01}
I always want to make the next
loaf even more delicious!
